  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בָּאִים&nbsp; בַּיָּמִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יוֹשְׁבִים בַּשְּׁעָרִים.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּיְּשִׁישִׁים - חָכְמָה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּזְּקֵנִים - עֵצָה.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְקָרְאוּ לוֹ - זִקְנֵי עִירוֹ.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאָמְרוּ אֵלָיו - דִּבְּרוּ אֶל לִבּוֹ.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הֲלֹא אָב אֶחָד לָכֶם,<br />יַבֵּם&nbsp;בֵּיתוֹ-בֵּיתְךָ-בֵּיתְכֶם.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><em data-end=\"346\" data-start=\"274\">הזקנים אינם ממהרים לענות, אלא מקשיבים - ואז אומרים מילה אחת ששווה אלף.</em></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נסה לשתוק רגע לפני שאתה מציע פתרון.<br />לפעמים ההקשבה היא הפתרון.</span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"סְתִירַת זְקֵנִים - בִּנְיָן.&nbsp;בִּנְיַן נְעָרִים - סְתִירָה\" (מסכת מגילה)</span><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\"השערה אל הזקנים\" = 823 = '</span><span style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-ring-color: rgb(49 99 217 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; background-color: white; background-repeat: no-repeat; border-color: rgb(227, 232, 241); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">שָׁלוֹם</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-ring-color: rgb(49 99 217 / .5); --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; background-color: white; background-repeat: no-repeat; border-color: rgb(227, 232, 241); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">וֶאֱמֶת'</span></p><p><br /></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px 20px 0px 0px;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>'</span><span><b>מֵאֵן</b>' / '</span><span><b>סָרֵיב</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ לא רוצה, לא מסכים - מסרב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>(לֹא) תִמְכְּרֶנָּה</b>' / '<b>לָא תְּזַבְּנִנַּהּ</b>'</span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;מוכר בחנות - זבן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>נְבָלָה</b>' / '<b>קְלָנָא</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ לא מכבד, מביש - קלון</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>שַׁעַר</b>' / '<b>תְרַע</b>'</span></span><br /></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;שיכול אותיות + חילוף ש-ת (כמו שָׁלֹשׁ-תְּלַת)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>אֲדֹנָיו</b>' / '<b>רִבּוֹנֵיהּ</b>'</span><br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">❖ השליט (שלו), המושל (שלו) - ריבון</span></li></ol><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoGTor-psHi49TEK-rgPXDYg0FuuBHE5goKL_IkNNSzYXWL3s8bzQn2GySOQoylofkt_3QfX2yxs5gP4-q9Ywoh7aHQ6ANtvWsolo6-x71ZjIIcKfAR5oTMo4X0uKQlTCttn80sJKLKgJYQtq-K77nIn_d1k0BV5Igp2e1rMZtssIc4s4kkomxZNiIh2c/s428/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgoGTor-psHi49TEK-rgPXDYg0FuuBHE5goKL_IkNNSzYXWL3s8bzQn2GySOQoylofkt_3QfX2yxs5gP4-q9Ywoh7aHQ6ANtvWsolo6-x71ZjIIcKfAR5oTMo4X0uKQlTCttn80sJKLKgJYQtq-K77nIn_d1k0BV5Igp2e1rMZtssIc4s4kkomxZNiIh2c/s428/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj7BUOHvdSIjLKutlEesU_flZJN8u3lrdBgcItLAqFAqNYJJmzzVG5zBAXfvW5raxawJ3QePMTuqu4NbqZ5Oak1pNyE5Cs1fKLs61zI2iEeIAyUeY_x4QrgVxzcO3NyuIBCV81i80R969ZCUXWo7s0fVFyhtOM3st_oq-FkUj1TIw_zLC1alN5HDk2v2ks/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2017,%202025,%2008_22_10%20PM.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1536\" height=\"133\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj7BUOHvdSIjLKutlEesU_flZJN8u3lrdBgcItLAqFAqNYJJmzzVG5zBAXfvW5raxawJ3QePMTuqu4NbqZ5Oak1pNyE5Cs1fKLs61zI2iEeIAyUeY_x4QrgVxzcO3NyuIBCV81i80R969ZCUXWo7s0fVFyhtOM3st_oq-FkUj1TIw_zLC1alN5HDk2v2ks/w200-h133/ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2017,%202025,%2008_22_10%20PM.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></div><br /></div></div></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אין חדש תחת השמש</sp